WEBVTT

00:02:58.246 --> 00:03:00.746
I wondered when were people
going to listen,

00:03:00.788 --> 00:03:02.246
where were the solutions?

00:03:02.246 --> 00:03:04.621
And where was the investment
into my community?

00:03:05.329 --> 00:03:07.996
In 2016, I broke the system

00:03:07.996 --> 00:03:11.121
and became the founder and CEO of B-360,

00:03:11.163 --> 00:03:12.829
carving out a new lane.

00:03:12.871 --> 00:03:14.829
I went back to my experience in the park.

00:03:14.871 --> 00:03:16.954
I thought about the kids
fixing their bikes.

00:03:16.954 --> 00:03:19.454
Those are skills people use
to pay the bills,

00:03:19.496 --> 00:03:21.871
just like mechanics
and mechanical engineers.

00:03:21.871 --> 00:03:23.663
We leaned into STEM.

00:03:23.663 --> 00:03:25.454
S -- Science.

00:03:25.496 --> 00:03:27.788
The science behind
popping the best wheelie,

00:03:27.829 --> 00:03:29.788
pulling your dirt bike at twelve o'clock

00:03:29.829 --> 00:03:30.996
is a physics equation.